===Move Relearner House===
House of the Move Relearner, she is able to teach a Pokémon any move that its species is able to learn by leveling up and Egg Moves. She requires a {{ItemIP|Heart Scale}} in exchange for her services.<br>
The Move Relearner will be available to offer her services after you rescue her by completing the Helper Requests at [[Kristiline Town]].<br>
The Special Egg Moves will only be learned after progressing through the story of chapter 13 and acquiring HM02 {{MoveIP|Fly}}.

