==Pokémon==
A flock of [[Swablu]] flying around Sensei's House at the Arena, can be interacted with for a battle.<br>
At the Cherry Blossom Inn, there is a Crush Girl that wants to trade her [[Smoochum]] for an [[Igglybuff]], it knows the move Fake Out and holds a Twisted Spoon.<br>
After completing the Battle Request 2 Help Request, the Player can claim a [[Clobbopus]] from the rewards counter, it knows the move Soak.<br>
During the [[Sidequests|Trade Me! Help Request]] a Trainer at the Arena will ask for an [[Aipom]] to trade for her [[Pancham]]<br>
After completing the story events in [[Carotos Mountain]], if the Player enters the house right from the move relearner's house [[Crescent]]'s [[Gothitelle]] will engage for battle, after winning there will be a Poké Ball on the ground holding in a [[Gothita]], it knows the moves Mirror Coat, Mean Look, and Psyshock.<br>
After claiming the third badge, an Agent from the Pokestar Studios is found right by the village's gate, she wants to find some suitable trainers for the [[Throh]] and [[Sawk]] that no longer want to be superstars for the show Pummel Bros, the Player will get to battle a Crazy Fan Girl on scene and get to claim Throh after battling it too. The Crazy Fan Girl then can be found in the Day Care Center and asks the Player to trade her the Throh for a bred Sawk she had.<br>
On a small grassy patch surfing left from the Day Care Center a [[Treecko]] is found starring at a tree, the Player can get its attention by offering a [[Gourmet Treat]] for a battle.

